    <string name="app_scale_title">App scale (%)</string>
    <string name="app_scale_summary">Makes apps and windows smaller while the desktop is on, so more content fits. 100 = unchanged; your own scale comes back when the desktop turns off. The taskbar keeps its size.</string>
