    <string name="shizuku_install_title">Install Shizuku</string>
    <string name="shizuku_install_body">Escritorio Glass uses Shizuku to see the open windows, close them and turn off the system pull-down panel. It is free and open source, and it only has these powers while you keep it started.</string>
    <string name="shizuku_install_action">Download on Play Store</string>
    <string name="shizuku_start_title">Shizuku is off</string>
    <string name="shizuku_start_body">It turns off every time the phone restarts. Open it and start it with wireless debugging; Escritorio Glass will notice by itself.</string>
